[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100100_03_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100100_03_0000","text":"电视的声音\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100100_03_0010","text":"“我想成为能让大家都打起精神的偶像！”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100100_03_0020","text":"“原来如此，我觉得你一定能行的～”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100100_03_0030","text":"“因为啊，你的笑容超棒的！”\n“果然偶像就是要靠笑容────！”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100100_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100100_03_0040","text":"哦……\n怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100100_03_0050","text":"好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100100_03_0060","text":"没有问题"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100100_03_0070","text":"嗯……不错啊\n很合身"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100100_03_0080","text":"……这种话就不必了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100100_03_0090","text":"哈哈……抱歉抱歉\n能拍一张照片留作记录吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100100_03_0100","text":"……要上了，圆香\n──────笑一个！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100100_03_0001","text":"Motion"}]
